Spoiler alert!












I have not seen mention of this, so it may not be generally known. If you
polymorph a line of (up to five) boulders, they change to statues,
many of which will have spellbooks inside them. Whereas the statues you
find randomly in the dungeon have only a low probability of having
spellbooks in them, the chance of getting spellbooks from polymorphed
boulders is quite high.

